  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nMidnight Acres was built using Unreal Engine 5 and features a beautiful and dynamic day and night system.<p></p>\n<p><b>Daytime Gameplay:</b><br>\nDuring the daytime, build and expand your farm and engage in casual and relaxing building &amp; management.</p>\n<p>Gather resources to upgrade your farm and defenses.</p>\n<p>Relax by exploring the world for treasures, fishing in various ponds and underground lakes, managing your farm, and more!</p>\n<p><b>Nighttime Gameplay:</b><br>\nWhen night falls, you must push back hordes of enemies trying to destroy you and your farm.</p>\n<p>Engage in intense FPS combat with various weapons.</p>\n<p>Use tower-defense elements to place and upgrade turrets and defenses for your farm.</p>\n<p><b>Exploration:</b><br>\nExplore a vast world with a sprawling cave system and rare collectibles… but beware.</p>\n<p>Monsters constantly patrol the underground and guard the most valuable treasures.</p>\n",
